# Secrets - never bake env files into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/build

# Not needed in the build context
.git
.githooks
docs
**/*.md
.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
